msgid ""
"The following example shows a general program flow involving the ``EVSPEC`` "
"calculations."
msgstr "以下示例展示了涉及 ``EVSPEC`` 计算的一般程序流程。"

msgid "``FCON,options [fcon]``"
msgstr "``FCON,options [fcon]``"

msgid ""
"The ``FCON`` program allows for the calculation of Franck-Condon factors "
"based on potential energy surfaces obtained from the ``XSURF`` program and "
"vibrational wavefunctions as provided by the ``VSCF`` or ``VCI`` programs. "
"Duschinsky effects may or may not be included. These can either be applied "
"to the vibrational wavefunction (of the vibrational ground state) or the "
"potential by using the ``PESTRANS`` program. The latter possibility is the "
"recommended one as it is significantly faster. The ``FCON`` program "
"including Duschinsky rotations can only be used with analytical "
"representations of the potential energy surfaces. A prescreening of the "
"Franck-Condon factors without Duschinsky effects at the ``VSCF`` level is "
"used to reduce the computational effort for correlated levels, e.g. ``VCI``."
" Note that, Franck-Condon factors at the uncorrelated ``VSCF`` level "
"including Duschinsky effects are usually of fairly poor quality. As the "
"calculation of Franck-Condon factors often involves very high quantum "
"numbers for the vibrational states of the final electronic state, very high "
"excitation levels must be enabled in the ``VCI`` calculations, i.e. see "
"keyword ``LEVEX``. For details see: P. Meier, G. Rauhut, *Comparison of "
"methods for calculating Franck-Condon factors beyond the harmonic "
"approximation: how important are Duschinsky rotations?*, `Mol. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2015.1074740>`__ **113**, 3859 (2015). "
"G. Rauhut, *Anharmonic Franck-Condon factors for the "
":math:`\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^2`B:math:`{}_1 \\longleftarrow "
"\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^1`A:math:`{}_1` photoionization of ketene*, J. Phys."
" Chem. A **119**, (2015) 10264."
msgstr ""
"``FCON`` 程序允许基于由 ``XSURF`` 程序获得的势能面和由 ``VSCF`` 或 ``VCI`` 程序提供的振动波函数来计算 "
"Franck-Condon 因子。可以包含或不包含 Duschinsky 效应。这些效应既可以通过 ``PESTRANS`` "
"程序施加于振动波函数（振动基态的），也可以施加于势能。后一种方案是推荐方案，因为它显著更快。包含 Duschinsky 旋转的 ``FCON`` "
"程序只能用于势能面的解析表示。在没有 Duschinsky 效应的情况下在 ``VSCF`` 水平上对 Franck-Condon "
"因子进行预筛选，用于减少相关水平（例如 ``VCI``\\ ）的计算量。注意，在不相关的 ``VSCF`` 水平上包含 Duschinsky 效应的 "
"Franck-Condon 因子通常质量相当差。由于计算 Franck-Condon 因子通常涉及最终电子态振动态的极高量子数，因此必须在 "
"``VCI`` 计算中启用非常高的激发能级，即参见关键字 ``LEVEX``\\ 。详情见：P. Meier, G. Rauhut, "
"*Comparison of methods for calculating Franck-Condon factors beyond the "
"harmonic approximation: how important are Duschinsky rotations?*, `Mol. "
"Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1080/00268976.2015.1074740>`__ **113**, 3859 "
"(2015). G. Rauhut, *Anharmonic Franck-Condon factors for the "
":math:`\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^2`B:math:`{}_1 \\longleftarrow "
"\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^1`A:math:`{}_1` photoionization of ketene*, J. Phys."
" Chem. A **119**, (2015) 10264."

msgid ""
"**``DUSCH``\\ =\\ *n*** This keyword controls the Duschinsky transformation."
" ``DUSCH=0`` entirely neglects the Duschinsky transformation - including the"
" shift-vector. ``DUSCH=3`` neglects the Duschinsky rotation, but includes "
"the shift-vector. This is the default option as the Duschinsky rotation can "
"be passed to the ``PESTRANS`` program, which is much more efficient."
msgstr ""
"**``DUSCH``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 此关键字控制 Duschinsky 变换。\\ ``DUSCH=0`` 完全忽略 "
"Duschinsky 变换——包括位移矢量。\\ ``DUSCH=3`` 忽略 Duschinsky 旋转，但包含位移矢量。这是默认选项，因为 "
"Duschinsky 旋转可以传递给 ``PESTRANS`` 程序，后者效率高得多。"

msgid ""
"**``ECKART``\\ =\\ *n*** ``ECKART=1`` (default) determines the Eckart "
"transformation matrix as described in the literature. ``ECKART=0`` "
"approximates the Eckart transformation matrix by a unit matrix, which is "
"meaningless unless for debugging purposes or for some very special tests."
msgstr ""
"**``ECKART``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``ECKART=1``\\ （默认）按文献所述确定 Eckart 变换矩阵。\\ "
"``ECKART=0`` 用单位矩阵近似 Eckart 变换矩阵，除非用于调试目的或某些非常特殊的测试，否则没有意义。"

msgid ""
"**``MAXSEL``\\ =\\ *n*** ``MAXSEL=n`` determines the maximum number of "
"Franck-Condon factors to be selected. By default *n* is set to 100."
msgstr ""
"**``MAXSEL``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** ``MAXSEL=n`` 确定要选择的 Franck-Condon 因子的最大数目。默认情况下 "
"*\\ n* 设为 100。"

msgid ""
"**``SEL``\\ =\\ *n*** This option switches the selection of Franck-Condon "
"factors based on VSCF calculation on (``SEL=1``) or off (``SEL=0``, "
"default)."
msgstr ""
"**``SEL``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 此选项基于 VSCF 计算开启（\\ ``SEL=1``\\ ）或关闭（\\ ``SEL=0``\\ "
"，默认）Franck-Condon 因子的选择。"

msgid ""
"**``THRDELTA``\\ =\\ *value*** The :math:`\\delta`-criterion is a threshold,"
" which allows for the prescreening of overlap integrals within the "
"evaluation of the Franck-Condon factors prior to their evaluation. The "
"default is set to 1.0d-8."
msgstr ""
"**``THRDELTA``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** :math:`\\delta` 判据是一个阈值，允许在计算 Franck-"
"Condon 因子之前对其计算中的重叠积分进行预筛选。默认值为 1.0d-8。"

msgid ""
"**``THRFCF``\\ =\\ *value*** The sum of all Franck-Condon factors is 1.0d0 "
"by definition. However, this value is hard to reach by sum over states "
"approaches. Therefore, it can be lowered by this keyword."
msgstr ""
"**``THRFCF``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 根据定义，所有 Franck-Condon 因子之和为 "
"1.0d0。然而，通过对态求和的方法很难达到该值。因此，可以通过此关键字将其降低。"

msgid ""
"**``THRFCFSPEC``\\ =\\ *value*** This threshold controls, if a Franck-Condon"
" factor will be considered within the plotting of the spectrum. See the "
"``PUT`` command and the ``IRSPEC`` style. The default is 1.0d-6."
msgstr ""
"**``THRFCFSPEC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 此阈值控制在绘制光谱时是否考虑某个 Franck-Condon 因子。参见 "
"``PUT`` 命令和 ``IRSPEC`` 样式。默认值为 1.0d-6。"

msgid ""
"**``THRPRINT``\\ =\\ *value*** This keyword defines the smallest value of a "
"Franck-Condon factor to be printed in the output. The default is set to "
"1.0d-99, i.e. this threshold usually is inactive."
msgstr ""
"**``THRPRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 此关键字定义在输出中打印的 Franck-Condon 因子的最小值。默认值为 "
"1.0d-99，即此阈值通常不起作用。"

msgid ""
"**``THRSEL``\\ =\\ *value*** This threshold controls, if a Franck-Condon "
"factor shall be selected and thus be considered in all subsequent "
"calculations or not. The default is 1.0d-5."
msgstr ""
"**``THRSEL``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 此阈值控制是否应选择某个 Franck-Condon "
"因子，从而在所有后续计算中予以考虑。默认值为 1.0d-5。"

msgid ""
"**``THRSKIPBAS``\\ =\\ *value*** Basis functions in the outer regions of the"
" potentials may be skipped within the calculation of Franck-Condon factors. "
"In particular within the approach of Doktorov, the CPU time depends strongly"
" on the number of basis functions. This keyword allows to skip such basis "
"functions and is given as the overlap integral of the modal. The default is "
"0.999999d0."
msgstr ""
"**``THRSKIPBAS``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 在计算 Franck-Condon "
"因子时，可以跳过势能外围区域中的基函数。特别是在 Doktorov 方法中，CPU "
"时间强烈依赖于基函数的数目。此关键字允许跳过此类基函数，其给定值为模态的重叠积分。默认值为 0.999999d0。"

msgid ""
"**``THRSUMSEL``\\ =\\ *value*** This threshold controls the sum of the "
"selected Franck-Condon factors, which must formally be 1.0d0. The default is"
" set to 0.999999d0."
msgstr ""
"**``THRSUMSEL``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 此阈值控制所选 Franck-Condon 因子之和，形式上必须为 "
"1.0d0。默认值为 0.999999d0。"

msgid ""
"**``THRVCIMIN``\\ =\\ *value*** Within the calculation of Franck-Condon "
"factors based on VCI wavefunctions, the leading VCI coefficient should be "
"largest in order to correspond to the state of interest. The default is set "
"to 0.01d0, which of course means that this keyword essentially is inactive."
msgstr ""
"**``THRVCIMIN``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 在基于 VCI 波函数计算 Franck-Condon 因子时，主导的 VCI "
"系数应为最大，以便对应于所关注的态。默认值为 0.01d0，这当然意味着此关键字实质上不起作用。"

msgid ""
"**``WF``\\ =\\ *type*** Defines the type of the wavefunction. ``WF=VSCF`` "
"specifies state-specific ``VSCF`` wavefunctions for both levels, while "
"``WF=VCI`` denotes state-specific ``VCI`` wavefunctions. Alternatively, one "
"may use ``WF=VSCFG`` for ground-state based VSCF wavefunctions and "
"``WF=VCIG`` for ground-state based VCI wavefunctions. The default is "
"``WF=VCI``."
msgstr ""
"**``WF``\\ =\\ *\\ type*** 定义波函数的类型。\\ ``WF=VSCF`` 为两个能级指定态特定的 ``VSCF`` "
"波函数，而 ``WF=VCI`` 表示态特定的 ``VCI`` 波函数。或者，可以使用 ``WF=VSCFG`` 表示基于基态的 VSCF 波函数，使用"
" ``WF=VCIG`` 表示基于基态的 VCI 波函数。默认值为 ``WF=VCI``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"``DISK,options\\\\`` As the Franck-Condon program requests the information "
"of two sets of potentials and wave functions, the information handling is "
"controlled by an extra directive. All the records provided here must refer "
"to the defaults or the explicitly given records in the preceding ``POLY``, "
"``VSCF`` and ``VCI`` calculations."
msgstr ""
"``DISK,options\\\\`` 由于 Franck-Condon "
"程序请求两组势能和波函数的信息，信息处理由一条额外的指令控制。此处提供的所有记录必须引用默认记录或前面 ``POLY``\\ 、\\ ``VSCF`` "
"和 ``VCI`` 计算中显式给出的记录。"

msgid ""
"**``FINAL``\\ =\\ *n*** Rather than specifying the records explicitly, the "
"number of the final state as defined in ``DISK`` directive of the ``POLY`` "
"program may be used."
msgstr "**``FINAL``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 不必显式指定记录，可以使用 ``POLY`` 程序 ``DISK`` 指令中定义的最终态编号。"

msgid ""
"**``INITIAL``\\ =\\ *n*** Rather than specifying the records explicitly, the"
" number of the initial state as defined in ``DISK`` directive of the "
"``POLY`` program may be used."
msgstr ""
"**``INITIAL``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 不必显式指定记录，可以使用 ``POLY`` 程序 ``DISK`` 指令中定义的初始态编号。"

msgid ""
"**``SURF1``\\ =\\ *record*** Specifies the record from where to read the "
"potential information for the final PES."
msgstr "**``SURF1``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 指定从哪个记录读取最终 PES 的势能信息。"

msgid ""
"**``SURF2``\\ =\\ *record*** Specifies the record from where to read the "
"potential information for the initial PES."
msgstr "**``SURF2``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 指定从哪个记录读取初始 PES 的势能信息。"

msgid ""
"**``VSCF1``\\ =\\ *record*** Specifies the record from where to read the "
"VSCF information for the final wave function."
msgstr "**``VSCF1``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 指定从哪个记录读取最终波函数的 VSCF 信息。"

msgid ""
"**``VSCF2``\\ =\\ *record*** Specifies the record from where to read the "
"VSCF information for the initial wave function."
msgstr "**``VSCF2``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 指定从哪个记录读取初始波函数的 VSCF 信息。"

msgid ""
"**``VCI1``\\ =\\ *record*** Specifies the record from where to read the VCI "
"information for the final wave function."
msgstr "**``VCI1``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 指定从哪个记录读取最终波函数的 VCI 信息。"

msgid ""
"**``VCI2``\\ =\\ *record*** Specifies the record from where to read the VCI "
"information for the initial wave function."
msgstr "**``VCI2``\\ =\\ *\\ record*** 指定从哪个记录读取初始波函数的 VCI 信息。"

