msgid "``EVSPEC,options [evspec]``"
msgstr "``EVSPEC,options [evspec]``"

msgid ""
"Similar to the ``FCON``, the ``EVSPEC`` program allows for the calculation "
"of anharmonic electronic-vibrational absorption spectra with the inclusion "
"of Duschinsky effects. In addition, it can take finite-temperature effects "
"into account as arising from the thermal population of the excited "
"vibrational levels of the electronic ground PES. The program requires a "
"precalculated set of initial VCI wavefuncions, a polynomial representation "
"of the final PES, and the corresponding VSCF ground-state modals. In "
"addition, the initial VCI states should be provided in the same set of "
"normal coordinates as the final PES, which is achieved by the coordinate "
"transformation of the potential energy function via the ``PESTRANS`` "
"program. All these aspect will be illustrated in the examples below."
msgstr ""
"与 ``FCON`` 类似，\\ ``EVSPEC`` 程序允许在包含 Duschinsky 效应的情况下计算非谐电子-"
"振动吸收光谱。此外，它还可以考虑由电子基态 PES 的激发振动态的热布居引起的有限温度效应。该程序需要一组预先计算的初始 VCI 波函数、最终 PES "
"的多项式表示以及相应的 VSCF 基态模态。此外，初始 VCI 态应在与最终 PES 相同的简正坐标集中提供，这通过 ``PESTRANS`` "
"程序对势能函数进行坐标变换来实现。所有这些方面将在下面的示例中加以说明。"

msgid ""
"There are basically two approaches employed in this module. The first one "
"consists in the determination of the eigenstates with the largest Franck-"
"Condon factors within the formalism of contracted invariant Krylov subspaces"
" (CIKS) by means of the Lanczos or RACE methods. Alternatively, the spectra "
"can be evaluated using the time-independent eigenstate-free ansatz based on "
"the inhomogeneous Schrödinger equation. The solution of this equation, the "
"so-called Raman wavefunction (RWF), is directly related to the spectral "
"intensities. For details see: T. Petrenko, G. Rauhut, *Time-independent "
"eigenstate-free calculation of vibronic spectra beyond the harmonic "
"approximation* , `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4937380>`__ "
"**143**, 234106 (2015). T. Petrenko, G. Rauhut, *A new efficient method for "
"the calculation of interior eigenpairs and its application to vibrational "
"structure problems* , `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4978581>`__ **146**, 124101 (2017). T. "
"Petrenko, G. Rauhut, *A general approach for calculating strongly anharmonic"
" vibronic spectra with a high density of states: the "
":math:`\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^2`B:math:`{}_1 \\longleftarrow "
"\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^1`A:math:`{}_1` photoelectron spectrum of "
"difluoromethane*, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.7b00468>`__ **13**, 5515 (2017). T. "
"Petrenko, G. Rauhut, *Refined analysis of the "
":math:`\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^2`A:math:`{}_2 \\longleftarrow "
"\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^1`A:math:`{}_1` photoelectron spectrum of furan* , "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5018928>`__ **148**, 054306 "
"(2018)."
msgstr ""
"此模块基本上采用两种方法。第一种方法是在收缩不变 Krylov 子空间（CIKS）形式下，通过 Lanczos 或 RACE 方法确定具有最大 "
"Franck-Condon 因子的本征态。或者，可以使用基于非齐次 Schrödinger 方程的无本征态时间无关拟设计算光谱。该方程的解，即所谓的 "
"Raman 波函数（RWF），与光谱强度直接相关。详情见：T. Petrenko, G. Rauhut, *Time-independent "
"eigenstate-free calculation of vibronic spectra beyond the harmonic "
"approximation* , `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4937380>`__ "
"**143**, 234106 (2015). T. Petrenko, G. Rauhut, *A new efficient method for "
"the calculation of interior eigenpairs and its application to vibrational "
"structure problems* , `J. Chem. Phys. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.4978581>`__ **146**, 124101 (2017). T. "
"Petrenko, G. Rauhut, *A general approach for calculating strongly anharmonic"
" vibronic spectra with a high density of states: the "
":math:`\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^2`B:math:`{}_1 \\longleftarrow "
"\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^1`A:math:`{}_1` photoelectron spectrum of "
"difluoromethane*, `J. Chem. Theory Comput. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.7b00468>`__ **13**, 5515 (2017). T. "
"Petrenko, G. Rauhut, *Refined analysis of the "
":math:`\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^2`A:math:`{}_2 \\longleftarrow "
"\\tilde{\\mbox{X}}\\,{}^1`A:math:`{}_1` photoelectron spectrum of furan* , "
"`J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.5018928>`__ **148**, 054306 "
"(2018)."

msgid ""
"``METHOD=CIKS|RWF`` Defines the method of calculation. ``METHOD=CIKS`` "
"specifies the CIKS approach which enables the determination of the "
"eigenstates with the most significant Franck-Condon factors. ``METHOD=RWF`` "
"denotes the eigenstate-free method based on the Raman wavefunction "
"formalism."
msgstr ""
"``METHOD=CIKS|RWF`` 定义计算方法。\\ ``METHOD=CIKS`` 指定 CIKS 方法，该方法能够确定具有最重要 "
"Franck-Condon 因子的本征态。\\ ``METHOD=RWF`` 表示基于 Raman 波函数形式的无本征态方法。"

msgid "``Default: METHOD=RWF.``"
msgstr "``Default: METHOD=RWF.``"

msgid "**``INITIAL``\\ =\\ *n1*, ``FINAL``\\ =\\ *n2***"
msgstr "**``INITIAL``\\ =\\ *\\ n1\\ *, ``FINAL``\\ =\\ *\\ n2***"

msgid ""
"These keywords provide the reference values for the initial and final PESs, "
"respectively. In this case, the option ``AUTO``\\ =\\ *n1* within the "
"``DISK`` directive of the ``POLY``, ``VSCF``, or ``VCI`` blocks would "
"attribute the respective computational results to the *initial* PES, while "
"``AUTO``\\ =\\ *n2* would attribute them to the *final* PES. ``Default: "
"INITIAL=1, FINAL=2.``"
msgstr ""
"这些关键字分别提供初始和最终 PES 的参考值。在这种情况下，\\ ``POLY``\\ 、\\ ``VSCF`` 或 ``VCI`` 块中 "
"``DISK`` 指令内的选项 ``AUTO``\\ =\\ *n1* 会将相应的计算结果归属于\\ *初始* PES，而 ``AUTO``\\ =\\"
" *n2* 会将其归属于\\ *最终* PES。\\ ``Default: INITIAL=1, FINAL=2.``"

msgid ""
"``ISTATES,options\\\\`` For a given temperature, the program can calculate "
"the spectrum with the contributions from all initial states which are found "
"in the VCI record. This directive provides the opportunity to control the "
"prescreening of the initial states based on their relative thermal "
"populations. The following options are possible:"
msgstr ""
"``ISTATES,options\\\\`` 对于给定温度，程序可以计算包含 VCI "
"记录中所有初始态贡献的光谱。该指令提供了基于初始态相对热布居对其预筛选进行控制的机会。可使用以下选项："

msgid "**``TEMPK``\\ =\\ *value*** Provides the temperature in Kelvin."
msgstr "**``TEMPK``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 提供以开尔文为单位的温度。"

msgid "``Default: TEMPK=300.0.``"
msgstr "``Default: TEMPK=300.0.``"

msgid ""
"**``THRPOP``\\ =\\ *value*** The initial states with the relative thermal "
"populations (with respect to the ground vibrational level) which are below "
"this parameter will be neglected."
msgstr "**``THRPOP``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 相对热布居（相对于基振动能级）低于此参数的初始态将被忽略。"

msgid "``Default: THRPOP=1.0d-3.``"
msgstr "``Default: THRPOP=1.0d-3.``"

msgid ""
"``RWF,options\\\\`` This directive provides various computational settings "
"which are specific to the RWF calculations. Currently, only the iterative "
"subspace algorithm of Lanczos type is implemented. The following options are"
" possible:"
msgstr ""
"``RWF,options\\\\`` 该指令提供特定于 RWF 计算的各种计算设置。目前仅实现了 Lanczos "
"类型的迭代子空间算法。可使用以下选项："

msgid ""
"**``ERANGE``\\ =\\ *value1,value2*** Defines the spectral range in 1/cm unit"
" for the RWF calculation relative to the 0-0 transition energy. In the case "
"that the eV unit is implied, see the explanation for the keyword ``EUNIT``."
msgstr ""
"**``ERANGE``\\ =\\ *\\ value1,value2*** 定义 RWF 计算中以 1/cm 为单位、相对于 0-0 "
"跃迁能量的光谱范围。如果隐含使用 eV 单位，请参见关键字 ``EUNIT`` 的说明。"

msgid ""
"Default: automatic determination of the spectral range with significant "
"intensity."
msgstr "默认：自动确定具有显著强度的光谱范围。"

msgid ""
"``EUNIT=CM|EV`` Defines the energy unit for the values specified via the "
"keywords ``ERANGE`` and ``GAMMA``. ``CM`` and ``EV`` stand for 1/cm and eV, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"``EUNIT=CM|EV`` 定义通过关键字 ``ERANGE`` 和 ``GAMMA`` 指定的值的能量单位。\\ ``CM`` 和 ``EV`` "
"分别代表 1/cm 和 eV。"

msgid "``Default: EUNIT=CM.``"
msgstr "``Default: EUNIT=CM.``"

msgid ""
"**``GAMMA``\\ =\\ *value*** Defines the damping factor in 1/cm unit. In the "
"case that the eV unit is implied, see the explanation for the keyword "
"``EUNIT``."
msgstr ""
"**``GAMMA``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 定义以 1/cm 为单位的阻尼因子。如果隐含使用 eV 单位，请参见关键字 "
"``EUNIT`` 的说明。"

msgid "``Default: GAMMA=100.0.``"
msgstr "``Default: GAMMA=100.0.``"

msgid "**``NLMAX``\\ =\\ *n*** Defines the maximum number of Lanczos iterations."
msgstr "**``NLMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 定义 Lanczos 迭代的最大次数。"

msgid "``Default: NLMAX=2000.``"
msgstr "``Default: NLMAX=2000.``"

msgid ""
"**``NSMAX``\\ =\\ *n*** Defines the maximum number of printed approximate "
"eigenstates representing the RWF."
msgstr "**``NSMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 定义表示 RWF 的打印近似本征态的最大数量。"

msgid "``Default: NSMAX=2000.``"
msgstr "``Default: NSMAX=2000.``"

msgid ""
"**``THRCONV``\\ =\\ *value*** Defines the convergence threshold for the RWF "
"in terms of the dimensionless squared residual norm for the inhomogeneous "
"Schrödinger equation."
msgstr "**``THRCONV``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 定义 RWF 的收敛阈值，以非齐次薛定谔方程的无量纲残差范数平方表示。"

msgid "``Default: THRCONV=1.0d-3.``"
msgstr "``Default: THRCONV=1.0d-3.``"

msgid ""
"**``THRFCF``\\ =\\ *value*** This is the threshold for the sum of the FCFs "
"which controls the number of printed approximate eigenstates representing "
"the RWF."
msgstr "**``THRFCF``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 这是 FCF 之和的阈值，用于控制表示 RWF 的打印近似本征态的数量。"

msgid "``Default: THRFCF=0.999.``"
msgstr "``Default: THRFCF=0.999.``"

msgid ""
"``CIKS,options\\\\`` This directive provides the computational settings that"
" are specific to the CIKS calculations. The following options are possible:"
msgstr "``CIKS,options\\\\`` 该指令提供特定于 CIKS 计算的计算设置。可使用以下选项："

msgid ""
"``METHOD=LCS|RACE`` Defines the method of calculation. Currently, two "
"choices are possible: Lanczos (``LCS``) and RACE (``RACE``) algorithms."
msgstr ""
"``METHOD=LCS|RACE`` 定义计算方法。目前有两种选择：Lanczos（\\ ``LCS``\\ ）和 RACE（\\ "
"``RACE``\\ ）算法。"

msgid "``Default: METHOD=RACE.``"
msgstr "``Default: METHOD=RACE.``"

msgid ""
"**``NDMAX``\\ =\\ *n*** Defines the maximum number of the state-specific "
"expansion vectors. It is valid only for ``METHOD=RACE``."
msgstr "**``NDMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 定义态特定展开向量的最大数量。仅对 ``METHOD=RACE`` 有效。"

msgid "``Default: NDMAX=1000.``"
msgstr "``Default: NDMAX=1000.``"

msgid ""
"**``NEVMAX``\\ =\\ *n*** Defines the maximum number of the eigenvectors to "
"be calculated in one batch (``NEVMAX``\\ :math:`\\leq`\\ ``NSMAX``)."
msgstr ""
"**``NEVMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 定义在一个批次中要计算的本征向量的最大数量（\\ ``NEVMAX``\\ "
":math:`\\leq`\\ ``NSMAX``\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"Default: ``NEVMAX=20`` for the RACE method, and ``NEVMAX=NLMAX`` for the "
"Lanczos one."
msgstr "默认：对于 RACE 方法 ``NEVMAX=20``\\ ，对于 Lanczos 方法 ``NEVMAX=NLMAX``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"Default: ``NLMAX=2000`` for the Lanczos method, and ``NLMAX=300`` for the "
"RACE one."
msgstr "默认：对于 Lanczos 方法 ``NLMAX=2000``\\ ，对于 RACE 方法 ``NLMAX=300``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``NSMAX``\\ =\\ *n*** Defines the maximum number of the eigenstates to be "
"calculated. The same number of states will be printed out."
msgstr "**``NSMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 定义要计算的本征态的最大数量。将打印相同数量的态。"

msgid ""
"Default: ``NSMAX=100`` for the RACE method, and ``NSMAX=NLMAX`` for the "
"Lanczos one."
msgstr "默认值：RACE 方法为 ``NSMAX=100``\\ ，Lanczos 方法为 ``NSMAX=NLMAX``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"**``THREN``\\ =\\ *value*** Defines the convergence threshold for the "
"calculated eigenstates in terms of the residual norm in Hartree unit."
msgstr "**``THREN``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 以 Hartree 为单位的残差范数形式定义所计算本征态的收敛阈值。"

msgid "``Default: THREN=1.0d-7.``"
msgstr "``默认值：THREN=1.0d-7。``"

msgid ""
"**``THRFCF``\\ =\\ *value*** This is the threshold for the sum of the FCFs "
"which additionally controls the total number of the calculated and printed "
"eigenstates."
msgstr "**``THRFCF``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 这是 FCF 之和的阈值，它额外控制所计算并打印的本征态总数。"

msgid ""
"``VCIBASIS,options\\\\`` This directive controls the choice of the "
"vibrational configuration basis. The following options are possible:"
msgstr "``VCIBASIS,options\\\\`` 该指令控制振动组态基的选择。可选选项如下："

msgid ""
"**``REFTYPE``\\ =\\ *n*** Controls the selection of the reference "
"configuration involved in the generation of the VCI basis. ``REFTYPE=1`` "
"refers to the ground vibrational configuration. The other choices are based "
"on the calculated modal-contracted Franck-Condon factors (MCFCFs). For "
"``REFTYPE=2``, the modals with the largest MCFCF is selected for the "
"respective components of the reference vector, while for ``REFTYPE=3``, one "
"takes the modal which approximately corresponds to the average of the MCFCF "
"distribution over the modals."
msgstr ""
"**``REFTYPE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 控制参与生成 VCI 基的参考组态的选择。\\ ``REFTYPE=1`` "
"指基态振动组态。其他选择基于所计算的模态收缩 Franck-Condon 因子（MCFCF）。对于 ``REFTYPE=2``\\ "
"，为参考向量的相应分量选择具有最大 MCFCF 的模态；而对于 ``REFTYPE=3``\\ ，选择近似对应于 MCFCF "
"分布在各模态上平均值的模态。"

msgid "``Default: REFTYPE=3.``"
msgstr "``默认值：REFTYPE=3。``"

msgid ""
"**``CIMAX``\\ =\\ *n*** Defines the maximum total excitation level over all "
"modes."
msgstr "**``CIMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 定义所有模态的最大总激发能级。"

msgid "``Default: CIMAX=6.``"
msgstr "``默认值：CIMAX=6。``"

msgid ""
"**``CITYPE``\\ =\\ *n*** Defines the maximum number of simultaneously "
"excited modes relative to the reference configuration."
msgstr "**``CITYPE``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 定义相对于参考组态同时激发的模态最大数目。"

msgid "``Default: CITYPE=4.``"
msgstr "``默认值：CITYPE=4。``"

msgid ""
"**``LEVEX``\\ =\\ *n*** Defines the maximum excitation level within a single"
" mode."
msgstr "**``LEVEX``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** 定义单个模态内的最大激发能级。"

msgid "``Default: LEVEX=4.``"
msgstr "``默认值：LEVEX=4。``"

msgid ""
"``HMAT,options\\\\`` This directive controls the construction of the VCI "
"Hamiltonian matrix. The following options are possible:"
msgstr "``HMAT,options\\\\`` 该指令控制 VCI 哈密顿矩阵的构造。可选选项如下："

msgid ""
"**``THRSPARSE``\\ =\\ *value*** Defines the threshold for neglecting the "
"off-diagonal elements in the Hamiltonian matrix stored in a packed sparse "
"form. The smaller is this value the higher are the memory demands, and the "
"computational cost of the matrix-vector multiplications. In particular, "
"setting ``THRSPARSE=0.0`` would not lead to any meaningful changes in the "
"calculated transition energies and intensities, but can easily increase the "
"memory demands by :math:`\\sim 10-10000` times as compared to the default "
"value."
msgstr ""
"**``THRSPARSE``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** "
"定义在以压缩稀疏形式存储的哈密顿矩阵中忽略非对角元的阈值。该值越小，内存需求以及矩阵-向量乘法的计算成本越高。特别地，设置 "
"``THRSPARSE=0.0`` 不会对计算得到的跃迁能量和强度带来任何有意义的变化，但与默认值相比，很容易使内存需求增加约 :math:`\\sim"
" 10-10000` 倍。"

msgid "``Default: THRSPARSE=1.0d-6.``"
msgstr "``默认值：THRSPARSE=1.0d-6。``"

msgid ""
"``GRAPH,options\\\\`` This directive controls the output of the calculated "
"spectra for plotting with the ``GNUPLOT`` program. Thus far, a single option"
" is available:"
msgstr "``GRAPH,options\\\\`` 该指令控制所计算光谱的输出，以便用 ``GNUPLOT`` 程序绘图。目前有一个可用选项："

msgid ""
"**``EVSDUMP``\\ =\\ *file name*** Provides the name of the gnuplot input "
"file."
msgstr "**``EVSDUMP``\\ =\\ *\\ file name*** 提供 gnuplot 输入文件的名称。"

msgid "``Default: EVSDUMP=’InputFileName.evs.gnu’.``"
msgstr "``默认值：EVSDUMP=’InputFileName.evs.gnu’。``"
